WEBVTT

00:00:01.180 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:11.700
Listen up.

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:14.190
If you ever try to win, I'll stop you.

00:00:14.190 --> 00:00:16.590
I'm protecting my own soccer.

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:18.870
Kurama-senpai...

00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:22.330
You heard what Fifth Sector ordered, did you?

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:24.330
Of course.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:27.770
Make it good.

00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:30.050
Is he a Seed too?

00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:34.610
The match begins with Mannouzaka's kickoff!

00:00:40.770 --> 00:00:42.020
What are you doing?!

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:47.940
Tsurugi avoids the scuffle and makes a back pass!

00:00:47.310 --> 00:00:47.940
What?

00:00:52.360 --> 00:00:55.050
G-Goal!

00:00:55.050 --> 00:00:57.430
The first point is an own goal!

00:00:57.430 --> 00:00:59.870
Raimon gets set back one point in friendly fire!

00:01:00.680 --> 00:01:02.540
Quit trying to scare me.

00:01:04.870 --> 00:01:06.950
I will destroy Raimon!

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:15.550
I was expecting him to try and stop us, but I didn't think he'd go this far!

00:01:18.860 --> 00:01:20.820
Not bad.

00:01:21.410 --> 00:01:23.340
We'll take it from here.

00:01:23.340 --> 00:01:26.110
Can't have you hogging all of the fun.

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:28.770
Interesting.

00:01:29.330 --> 00:01:31.030
Then show me.

00:01:31.030 --> 00:01:33.470
Let's see if you guys can crush Raimon.

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:36.520
I won't lose!

00:03:08.950 --> 00:03:13.920
<b>The Avatar's Miracle<i>!</i> Mannouzaka Jr. High<i>!!</i></b>

00:03:15.780 --> 00:03:19.390
The national tournament that will decide the number one junior high school in Japan, Holy Road!

00:03:19.390 --> 00:03:21.930
This is the second match in Kanto's A block district preliminaries!

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:27.670
In the opening of Mannouzaka versus Raimon, Raimon loses their first point in seconds by an unbelievable own goal!

00:03:27.670 --> 00:03:31.040
The score is currently 1-0 with Mannouzaka in the lead.

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:33.350
Can Raimon catch up?!

00:03:35.010 --> 00:03:36.730
Tsurugi is the enemy.

00:03:36.730 --> 00:03:39.560
Which means we have a wolf in sheep's clothing here.

00:03:39.560 --> 00:03:41.680
It was obvious this would happen anyway.

00:03:43.460 --> 00:03:46.630
Why did Coach put Tsurugi in the game?

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:50.960
Shindou, if you're gonna give up, now's your chance.

00:03:51.470 --> 00:03:54.980
You can still follow orders and lose this game at 1-0.

00:03:54.980 --> 00:03:57.050
No, my mind's made up.

00:03:57.710 --> 00:04:01.880
We'll win Holy Road and get real soccer back.

00:04:04.170 --> 00:04:06.220
As if I'll let that happen.

00:04:09.800 --> 00:04:12.180
I won't let them score any more.

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:18.610
The match resumes with Raimon's kickoff!

00:04:20.310 --> 00:04:20.860
Tenma!

00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:21.470
What?!

00:04:21.870 --> 00:04:25.150
Shindou makes an unexpected pass to Matsukaze!

00:04:25.150 --> 00:04:27.110
Matsukaze dribbles up!

00:04:27.110 --> 00:04:28.770
Go, Tenma!

00:04:28.770 --> 00:04:30.200
Tenma, you can do it!

00:04:30.650 --> 00:04:33.210
Mannouzaka arrives to steal the ball!

00:04:33.210 --> 00:04:33.940
It's mine!

00:04:34.310 --> 00:04:36.110
Soyokaze Step!

00:04:41.130 --> 00:04:42.950
Matsukaze sidesteps him!

00:04:42.950 --> 00:04:43.760
Okay!

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:48.300
But Isozaki goes in to backup and steals the ball!

00:04:49.930 --> 00:04:51.140
Mannouzaka moves up!

00:04:51.140 --> 00:04:53.030
Will they be using the sides?

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:54.730
Shirato!

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:08.280
Hamano!

00:05:07.040 --> 00:05:08.280
Hamano-senpai!

00:05:11.560 --> 00:05:13.620
Guess he isn't all talk.

00:05:14.090 --> 00:05:15.760
Hamano isn't getting back up!

00:05:15.760 --> 00:05:17.110
This is worrying.

00:05:17.110 --> 00:05:18.610
Is he all right?

00:05:19.590 --> 00:05:21.200
I'm fine, I'm fine!

00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:25.260
It was so in-my-face, I missed my chance to cut it.

00:05:27.620 --> 00:05:29.000
He's up!

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:30.450
He looks unhurt!

00:05:30.820 --> 00:05:33.730
Still, that ball...

00:05:33.730 --> 00:05:36.800
From the force he used, I don't think it was a normal pass.

00:05:40.090 --> 00:05:41.570
This is gonna be easy.

00:05:45.390 --> 00:05:47.730
Are those guys...?

00:05:48.970 --> 00:05:50.790
The game resumes with Mannouzaka's throw-in!

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:52.670
They can't have it!

00:05:54.070 --> 00:05:54.640
Ushio!

00:05:55.650 --> 00:05:56.360
Busujima!

00:05:56.360 --> 00:05:57.750
I won't let you!

00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:02.120
1...

00:06:02.120 --> 00:06:03.000
2...

00:06:03.270 --> 00:06:03.840
3!

00:06:06.350 --> 00:06:07.170
Tenma!

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:08.880
Busujima!

00:06:12.920 --> 00:06:17.020
They're luring them in the last minute to make the greatest damage, huh?

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:19.440
That movement... it has to be!

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:22.010
Everyone, be careful!

00:06:22.010 --> 00:06:24.360
They're planning to hurt us!

00:06:24.810 --> 00:06:25.860
Hurt us?

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:29.150
Just like last time!

00:06:36.340 --> 00:06:37.900
So that's why they made those kicks!

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:44.720
It's too late realizing that now.

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:48.170
I won't let you!

00:06:51.860 --> 00:06:52.570
Shinsuke!

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:54.730
That was a dangerous play!

00:06:54.730 --> 00:06:55.850
Where's the yellow card?!

00:06:57.040 --> 00:06:58.350
There's no whistle!

00:06:59.920 --> 00:07:01.690
Where are you looking, ref?!

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:03.300
That was clearly a foul!

00:07:03.910 --> 00:07:06.990
His teammates are hiding him so the referee won't see.

00:07:07.720 --> 00:07:08.530
Hiding him?

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:14.030
No matter how rough they play, the ref won't call a foul on them if he can't see it.

00:07:14.860 --> 00:07:16.740
What are these guys, professionals at foul-proofing?

00:07:19.700 --> 00:07:21.470
How dare you hurt Shinsuke!

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:24.340
If you stay there, you'll get hurt!

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:26.340
Tenma!

00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:49.070
Kirino-senpai!

00:07:49.910 --> 00:07:52.200
This has become an astonishing development!

00:07:52.200 --> 00:07:56.180
The Raimon Eleven are being taken down by Mannouzaka's rough plays!

00:07:57.150 --> 00:07:58.660
I can't watch this!

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:01.120
Sangoku is moving up!

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:04.320
Fifth Sector ordered a score of 1-0!

00:08:04.660 --> 00:08:08.320
That means no one will move to get another point even if I left the goal open!

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:11.490
You stay back!

00:08:17.500 --> 00:08:18.850
Sangoku-senpai!

00:08:22.070 --> 00:08:23.760
W-We're doomed...

00:08:23.760 --> 00:08:29.110
This is why I said we shouldn't disobey Fifth Sector...

00:08:31.010 --> 00:08:31.780
Here.

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:34.650
It's your turn now.

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:39.870
Hayami!

00:08:43.670 --> 00:08:45.200
This is my fault.

00:08:45.200 --> 00:08:48.690
It's because I kept saying I was going to win...

00:08:50.350 --> 00:08:51.760
Buh-bye.

00:08:54.280 --> 00:08:54.910
Shin-sama!

00:08:55.640 --> 00:08:58.960
We can't win against Fifth Sector after all...

00:08:59.840 --> 00:09:02.970
Is it not possible to take back our real soccer?

00:09:15.580 --> 00:09:17.400
It's over.

00:09:27.270 --> 00:09:28.960
Man, these guys suck.

00:09:29.390 --> 00:09:33.780
If this is all they've got, we didn't have to waste our energy on them.

00:09:34.170 --> 00:09:35.050
Wait!

00:09:36.650 --> 00:09:37.940
The game...

00:09:38.650 --> 00:09:41.800
Isn't over yet!

00:09:42.340 --> 00:09:43.100
Tenma!

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:45.890
Him again.

00:09:46.220 --> 00:09:48.900
Matsukaze Tenma...

00:09:51.190 --> 00:09:53.880
We can't have that.

00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:58.270
You need to go to sleep like the rest of them!

00:10:17.350 --> 00:10:17.750
What?

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:22.970
He took on Isozaki-san's ball and he still stood up?

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:27.000
I will... I will protect soccer.

00:10:27.720 --> 00:10:31.730
For that, I have to keep winning!

00:10:32.100 --> 00:10:34.470
You little brat!

00:10:34.840 --> 00:10:36.130
I'll crush you!

00:10:39.660 --> 00:10:40.640
Tenma!

00:10:45.300 --> 00:10:47.400
Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:10:50.420 --> 00:10:52.910
Inazuma Eleven GO!

00:11:05.350 --> 00:11:07.070
Quit wasting our time!

00:11:08.420 --> 00:11:11.230
I have... to win!

00:11:23.600 --> 00:11:25.030
It's just like last time.

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:29.420
He's moving in ways that minimizes the damage he takes on.

00:11:42.830 --> 00:11:45.490
I have to win.

00:11:45.810 --> 00:11:47.360
You little...!

00:11:47.360 --> 00:11:48.580
Out of the way!

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:50.910
The way you guys do things is too slow!

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:55.650
This is how you destroy someone!

00:11:57.530 --> 00:11:58.230
Tsurugi!

00:12:14.020 --> 00:12:16.020
I have to win.

00:12:16.990 --> 00:12:18.010
Why?

00:12:18.010 --> 00:12:19.710
Why are you standing back up?

00:12:19.710 --> 00:12:20.990
Why?

00:12:22.430 --> 00:12:25.220
Because I love soccer!

00:12:29.530 --> 00:12:30.350
Do it!

00:12:32.470 --> 00:12:33.680
Okay then.

00:12:33.680 --> 00:12:34.830
In that case...

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:37.150
Just try and protect it.

00:12:37.460 --> 00:12:41.060
Beat us and protect your beloved soccer.

00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:43.490
I will!

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:52.920
That sliding...

00:12:52.920 --> 00:12:55.460
Are they going for his leg?!

00:12:59.660 --> 00:13:00.570
Tenma!

00:13:00.570 --> 00:13:02.090
What? He aimed on purpose!

00:13:03.220 --> 00:13:04.780
I-I'm fine!

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:07.470
Damn, I missed!

00:13:08.010 --> 00:13:09.740
It's not my imagination.

00:13:09.740 --> 00:13:10.970
They're planning to smash it to pieces.

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:14.140
Then I'll finish this!

00:13:14.140 --> 00:13:15.480
You can't escape this time!

00:13:25.420 --> 00:13:26.310
What the hell?!

00:13:28.940 --> 00:13:31.390
Is this how you bring down others?

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:33.270
Don't you think you're going overboard?

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:35.390
What are you talking about?

00:13:35.700 --> 00:13:37.700
Don't play dumb.

00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:42.630
If you got away with that sliding, you would have clearly broken his leg.

00:13:43.200 --> 00:13:44.870
So what?

00:13:44.870 --> 00:13:49.340
Someone like him deserves never to play soccer again!

00:13:51.620 --> 00:13:52.670
<i>Kyousuke!</i>

00:13:56.120 --> 00:13:59.490
<i>Sorry, could you give us back the ball?</i>

00:13:59.490 --> 00:14:00.360
<i>Sure!</i>

00:14:05.800 --> 00:14:07.580
You bastard!

00:14:07.580 --> 00:14:09.210
Are you for real?

00:14:26.750 --> 00:14:28.560
Death Sword!

00:14:33.860 --> 00:14:35.930
Goal!

00:14:35.930 --> 00:14:42.020
W-What?! This time, Tsurugi cancels out his own goal to make the score a tie!

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:47.470
And there's the whistle!

00:14:47.470 --> 00:14:50.660
The first half ends at a tie of 1-1!

00:14:52.050 --> 00:14:54.120
What... just happened?

00:15:00.290 --> 00:15:01.060
Tsurugi...

00:15:01.840 --> 00:15:04.960
I thought you said you were going to destroy soccer.

00:15:06.310 --> 00:15:07.580
I am.

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:11.690
I'll destroy this corrupted soccer with my own hands!

00:15:12.020 --> 00:15:13.030
Tsurugi...

00:15:14.910 --> 00:15:15.940
Could it be...

00:15:17.170 --> 00:15:20.430
Did Coach know all along that this would happen?

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:23.440
Tsurugi!

00:15:24.430 --> 00:15:25.400
Thanks.

00:15:31.360 --> 00:15:34.430
T-Tsurugi-kun made a goal in our favor?!

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:39.910
With the first half over, it's at a tie of 1-1.

00:15:40.120 --> 00:15:41.570
A tie?

00:15:41.570 --> 00:15:45.630
Isn't Tsurugi-kun a Seed sent by Fifth Sector?

00:15:45.630 --> 00:15:47.750
Why would someone like him make a shoot?!

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:49.800
Don't ask me...

00:15:50.140 --> 00:15:54.090
Is that Coach Endou behind this again?

00:15:58.850 --> 00:16:02.410
Honestly, you really need to learn how to conserve your energy.

00:16:02.410 --> 00:16:03.630
But...

00:16:04.030 --> 00:16:05.480
You looked cool out there.

00:16:05.480 --> 00:16:06.830
Keep it up in the second half, Tenma!

00:16:07.160 --> 00:16:10.610
Midori-san, don't encourage him!

00:16:12.500 --> 00:16:14.770
You'll have to sit out the second half.

00:16:14.770 --> 00:16:16.190
I'm sorry, Kirino.

00:16:16.510 --> 00:16:18.860
Don't worry about it, Shindou.

00:16:18.860 --> 00:16:20.380
It's not your fault.

00:16:21.220 --> 00:16:22.060
Shindou.

00:16:23.270 --> 00:16:24.620
Are you keeping this up in the second half?

00:16:29.060 --> 00:16:31.080
If you are, then you're on your own.

00:16:31.080 --> 00:16:34.210
We'll have nothing to do with this match.

00:16:35.550 --> 00:16:36.830
Kurumada-san!

00:16:40.670 --> 00:16:43.280
Today's match made it crystal clear.

00:16:43.280 --> 00:16:46.210
We'll just get punished if we fight against Fifth Sector.

00:16:46.210 --> 00:16:51.140
Like we said, it's unreasonable to think we can take back soccer and whatnot.

00:16:51.450 --> 00:16:53.320
But if we keep winning...

00:16:53.770 --> 00:16:54.990
You shut up!

00:16:57.660 --> 00:16:58.720
I understand.

00:16:59.960 --> 00:17:03.450
I apologize for getting you involved in this.

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:06.640
But the rest of us will fight anyway.

00:17:06.640 --> 00:17:08.680
Even if only five people are left on the team!

00:17:08.680 --> 00:17:09.690
Captain.

00:17:16.670 --> 00:17:17.960
Suit yourself.

00:17:19.100 --> 00:17:20.170
Endou-san...

00:17:23.740 --> 00:17:25.750
The second half is ready to begin.

00:17:26.440 --> 00:17:28.730
Both teams are in position.

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:34.250
What's with Raimon's new formation?

00:17:35.550 --> 00:17:40.340
Kurumada, Kurama, Hamano, Hayami, and Amagi are lined up along the touchlines!

00:17:40.610 --> 00:17:42.680
What in the world is going on?!

00:17:48.160 --> 00:17:49.880
Okay, let's go!

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:54.420
After all the pain we gave them, four of them are still hanging in.

00:17:54.420 --> 00:17:57.120
Then we'll just have to use a different way.

00:17:58.130 --> 00:17:59.370
A different way?

00:17:59.940 --> 00:18:01.510
Make them have a taste...

00:18:02.530 --> 00:18:04.390
...of true despair.

00:18:05.180 --> 00:18:07.780
It's true that he made a goal for us, but...

00:18:08.880 --> 00:18:12.360
Is it really okay to trust him?

00:18:14.400 --> 00:18:17.500
The second half begins with Raimon's kickoff!

00:18:17.500 --> 00:18:19.800
The score is 1-1!

00:18:19.800 --> 00:18:22.760
Which team will make the tiebreaking goal?!

00:18:22.760 --> 00:18:23.740
Give it to me.

00:18:25.010 --> 00:18:26.450
Tsurugi runs forward!

00:18:28.060 --> 00:18:29.720
Now it begins.

00:18:29.720 --> 00:18:31.060
Watch closely!

00:18:31.060 --> 00:18:33.000
<i>This</i>  is real soccer!

00:18:34.400 --> 00:18:36.120
Is he going to face them all on his own?

00:18:36.550 --> 00:18:37.550
I won't let you!

00:18:38.280 --> 00:18:40.010
Tsurugi slips past him!

00:18:40.770 --> 00:18:43.030
Dodging all of his opponents, Tsurugi moves up rapidly!

00:18:43.350 --> 00:18:44.650
Tsurugi's awesome!

00:18:44.650 --> 00:18:45.910
Just what you'd expect from a Seed!

00:18:45.910 --> 00:18:46.870
Yeah!

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:48.020
We can do this!

00:18:56.660 --> 00:18:58.740
Tsurugi has gotten through the defense!

00:19:00.820 --> 00:19:04.690
I let my guard down earlier, but that won't happen this time.

00:19:19.180 --> 00:19:21.130
Death Sword!

00:19:29.270 --> 00:19:29.980
An Avatar?

00:19:31.920 --> 00:19:34.230
Machine Soldier Galleus!

00:19:37.100 --> 00:19:39.650
He blocks Tsurugi's Death Sword!

00:19:45.160 --> 00:19:47.330
So he was a Seed too.

00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:49.780
Don't be surprised just yet.

00:19:50.250 --> 00:19:51.150
Mitsuyoshi!

00:19:53.010 --> 00:19:54.940
Now it's my turn.

00:19:58.730 --> 00:19:59.690
What?

00:20:02.770 --> 00:20:05.340
Conjurer Purim!

00:20:05.610 --> 00:20:07.350
He has an Avatar too?!

00:20:10.660 --> 00:20:12.600
Magician's Box!

00:20:26.150 --> 00:20:29.790
Burning Catch!

00:20:38.330 --> 00:20:40.230
Goal!

00:20:40.230 --> 00:20:41.760
Mannouzaka gets the next point!

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:46.140
Minutes into the start of the second half, and Raimon has been pushed down at a score of 2-1!

00:20:53.140 --> 00:20:54.850
Th-This can't be...

00:20:54.850 --> 00:20:57.220
They have three Seeds?

00:21:05.900 --> 00:21:07.460
Well, Tsurugi.

00:21:07.460 --> 00:21:12.410
Let's see you try and stop us with this "real"  soccer of yours.

00:23:24.750 --> 00:23:27.090
Tsurugi! Let's have a card game battle!

00:23:27.880 --> 00:23:28.800
Sure.

00:23:29.590 --> 00:23:31.750
I'll level up by connecting this bond.

00:23:34.530 --> 00:23:35.640
Take this!

00:23:35.640 --> 00:23:37.410
Death Sword!

00:23:38.220 --> 00:23:40.270
Sangoku-senpai, I'm counting on you!

00:23:40.270 --> 00:23:42.210
Burning Catch!

00:23:42.850 --> 00:23:44.340
I'll be the one to win!

00:23:44.340 --> 00:23:46.070
Burning Chance!

00:23:49.010 --> 00:23:50.440
Is that all you've got?

00:23:50.440 --> 00:23:52.910
Start yours with your Starter Set today!

00:23:53.780 --> 00:23:57.340
We'll win to get back real soccer!

00:23:57.340 --> 00:24:00.190
Raimon's soccer club is finally risen from the ashes!

00:24:00.190 --> 00:24:03.790
Next on Inazuma Eleven GO, 
 Raimon Awakens?!

00:24:03.790 --> 00:24:05.630
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:24:15.100 --> 00:24:17.890
The Inazuma Eleven GO's proverb today is...

00:24:21.970 --> 00:24:25.470
We'll fight anyway. 
Even if only five people are left!

